<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγκελος</span></b> , ὁ,= Lat.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cancelli, barrier,
				starting-gate</i>, in races, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				8.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγκελλοι</span></b> , οἱ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.1681
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Plataea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2146.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>:—whence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγκελλάριος</span></b> , ὁ,
			orig. <i>usher</i> at the (lattice-work) bar of a court, then 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογοθέτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.36
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				5.19
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγκελον</span></b> , τό,
				<i>bar</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δικαστηρίου</span>
			Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				641
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				675
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγγελλον</span></b> ,
				<i>railing, balustrade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				233.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: —hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγκελο-ειδῶς</span></b> , Adv.
			<i>like a grating, criss-cross,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				117
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λλ-</span>
			):</div>
